Derivative changes by the xiaohongshu-mcp-chatgpt maintainers:
- MCP Apps image viewer and separate model-only ImageContent reader.
- Share-link resolution and single-call note reading with limited initial comments.
- Follow/unfollow state checks, idempotence, and optional protected users.
- ChatGPT attachment import, expiring server-side image handles, and local image validation.
- Publish editor stabilization, timeout budgeting, and official AI-content declaration verification.
- Supporting tools, handlers, tests, and public documentation/configuration.

Modified or added derivative source files carry a prominent modification notice.
Public packaging additionally supplies an independent README, environment example,
loopback-only Compose template, safe CI workflow, and expanded ignore rules.
Two existing tests were adjusted for validator error ordering and Windows temporary
directory environment variables; production logic is unchanged by those adjustments.
The video parameter description replaces an absolute user-directory example with
a server-local path description; its schema type and behavior are unchanged.

No private Git history, runtime data, credentials, or production deployment
configuration is included in this source distribution.
